al structures, libraries, or customized sets for your next screening project. We can help you with the structure, substructure, fragment, functional groups, similarity searches, and compound selection based on chemical-physical properties. E-mail to &lt;a href="javascript:f1f671f5ab(['timtec','timtec.org'].join('&amp;#64;'));"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;form action="https://www.timtec.net/category/1-hts-compounds-for-screening.html" method="post" name="adminForm"&gt;&lt;div class="pd-c-download-box"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="clear"&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div id="rt-content-bottom"&gt; &lt;div class="rt-grid-16 rt-alpha rt-omega"&gt; &lt;div class="title1"&gt; &lt;div class="rt-block"&gt; &lt;div class="rt-module-inner"&gt; &lt;div class="module-content"&gt; &lt;table align="left" border="0" style="height: 100px; width: 600px;"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td style="text-align: center;"&gt; &lt;a href="http://50.243.63.101:8081/cws/loginUser.asp" title="Structure Search" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;img alt="Structure Search" src="/images/stories/icons/Search50.png" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td style="text-align: center;"&gt; &lt;a href="http://www.echemstore.com" title="TimTec eChemStore"&gt;&lt;img alt="Shop Online" src="/images/stories/icons/CartWhite.png" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td style="text-align: center;"&gt; &lt;a href="/home/download-databases.html" title="Download Databases"&gt;&lt;img alt="Download Databases" src="/images/stories/icons/zip50.png" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td style="text-align: center;" valign="middle"&gt; &lt;a href="/company/contact-us.html" title="Request a CD"&gt;&lt;img alt="Request a CD" src="/images/stories/icons/CD_Download.png" style="margin-right: 6px; margin-left: 6px;" title="Get compound structures" width="50" /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="/company/contact-us.html" title="Request a CD"